{"id": "tpcds-001", "level": "noob", "nl_description": "I need a databse for a retail store that sells stuff. The store keeps track of its invantory items -- each item has a name, description, a price and a wholesale cost, and belongs to a catagory like shoes or electronics or childrens clothing (there are about 10 catgories). Items also have a brand and come in difrent sizes and colors. Custumers can come into the store and buy things. When they buy stuff we record a sale with how many items they bought (up to 100 at a time), the price, and how much they actualy paid after any discounts or cupons. We also need to track returns when custumers bring stuff back. Sales and returns are both linked to the same items.", "ground_truth_schema": {"tables": [{"name": "ITEM", "pk": "i_item_sk", "columns": [{"name": "i_item_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "i_item_id", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_item_desc", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_current_price", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "i_wholesale_cost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "i_brand_id", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "i_brand", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_class", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_category_id", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "i_category", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_size", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_color", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER", "pk": "c_customer_sk", "columns": [{"name": "c_customer_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_customer_id", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_first_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_last_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_birth_year", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_preferred_cust_flag", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "STORE_SALES", "pk": "ss_item_sk", "columns": [{"name": "ss_sold_date_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_item_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_customer_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_ticket_number", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_quantity", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_list_price", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_sales_price", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_ext_discount_amt", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_coupon_amt", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_net_paid", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_net_profit", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "STORE_RETURNS", "pk": "sr_item_sk", "columns": [{"name": "sr_returned_date_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "sr_item_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "sr_customer_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "sr_ticket_number", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "sr_return_quantity", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "sr_return_amt", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "sr_net_loss", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}], "relationships": [{"referencing_table": "STORE_SALES", "referencing_column": "ss_item_sk", "referred_table": "ITEM"}, {"referencing_table": "STORE_SALES", "referencing_column": "ss_customer_sk", "referred_table": "CUSTOMER"}, {"referencing_table": "STORE_RETURNS", "referencing_column": "sr_item_sk", "referred_table": "ITEM"}, {"referencing_table": "STORE_RETURNS", "referencing_column": "sr_customer_sk", "referred_table": "CUSTOMER"}]}, "ground_truth_distributions": {"STORE_SALES.ss_quantity": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1.0, "high": 100.0}}, "STORE_SALES.ss_net_paid": {"family": "normal", "params": {"mean": 50.0, "std": 30.0}}, "ITEM.i_current_price": {"family": "lognormal", "params": {"mu": 3.5, "sigma": 1.2}}}}
{"id": "tpcds-002", "level": "noob", "nl_description": "A shop wants to track custumers and the things they bought. Custumers have a first and last name, a salutation (Mr Mrs etc), birthday, what country they're from, email adress, and a flag if they're a prefered custumer. Custumers are linked to a seperate table for their demogrphics which stores gender, marital status, education level, a estimated annual spending amount, and credit rating. Also we need a date diminsion with info about each calendar day like what year, month, day of week it is, if it's a holiday, if it's a weeknd, and whether it's in the curent year or curent month. Items for sale have prices, costs, brands, and belong to catgories.", "ground_truth_schema": {"tables": [{"name": "DATE_DIM", "pk": "d_date_sk", "columns": [{"name": "d_date_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_date_id", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "d_date", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "d_year", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_moy", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_dom", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_dow", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_holiday", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "d_weekend", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "d_current_month", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "d_current_year", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "ITEM", "pk": "i_item_sk", "columns": [{"name": "i_item_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "i_item_id", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_item_desc", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_current_price", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "i_wholesale_cost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "i_brand", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_class", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_category", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_color", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_size", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER", "pk": "c_customer_sk", "columns": [{"name": "c_customer_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_customer_id", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_current_cdemo_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_salutation", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_first_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_last_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_preferred_cust_flag", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_birth_day", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_birth_month", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_birth_year", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_birth_country", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_email_address", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER_DEMOGRAPHICS", "pk": "cd_demo_sk", "columns": [{"name": "cd_demo_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "cd_gender", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "cd_marital_status", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "cd_education_status", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "cd_purchase_estimate", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "cd_credit_rating", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "cd_dep_count", "data_type": "INT"}]}], "relationships": [{"referencing_table": "CUSTOMER", "referencing_column": "c_current_cdemo_sk", "referred_table": "CUSTOMER_DEMOGRAPHICS"}]}, "ground_truth_distributions": {"ITEM.i_current_price": {"family": "lognormal", "params": {"mu": 3.5, "sigma": 1.2}}, "CUSTOMER.c_birth_year": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 1924.0, "high": 1992.0}}, "CUSTOMER_DEMOGRAPHICS.cd_dep_count": {"family": "uniform", "params": {"low": 0.0, "high": 9.0}}}}
{"id": "tpcds-003", "level": "intermediate", "nl_description": "Retail analytics database with three separate sales channels: physical stores, web orders, and catalog orders. All three channels share the same product catalog, customer registry, and date dimension. The date dimension covers calendar and fiscal attributes, holiday flags, and day/week/month sequence numbers. The item catalog uses slowly changing dimension type 2 -- each item has a start and end date for the record. Items have prices, wholesale costs, brands, classes, categories (10 total), manufacturers, and physical attributes. Customers are linked to demographics (gender, marital status, education, purchase estimate, credit rating, dependent counts) and household demographics (income band, household count). Store sales and web sales each have extensive measures: quantity up to 100, list price, sales price, wholesale cost, extended amounts, tax, coupons, and net profit. Returns are tracked separately for each channel and reference the original ticket number.", "ground_truth_schema": {"tables": [{"name": "DATE_DIM", "pk": "d_date_sk", "columns": [{"name": "d_date_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_date_id", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "d_date", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "d_month_seq", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_week_seq", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_quarter_seq", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_year", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_dow", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_moy", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_dom", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_qoy", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "d_holiday", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "d_weekend", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "d_current_year", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "ITEM", "pk": "i_item_sk", "columns": [{"name": "i_item_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "i_item_id", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_rec_start_date", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "i_rec_end_date", "data_type": "DATE"}, {"name": "i_item_desc", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_current_price", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "i_wholesale_cost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "i_brand_id", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "i_brand", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_class_id", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "i_class", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_category_id", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "i_category", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_manufact_id", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "i_manufact", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_size", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "i_color", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER", "pk": "c_customer_sk", "columns": [{"name": "c_customer_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_customer_id", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_current_cdemo_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_current_hdemo_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_current_addr_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_salutation", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_first_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_last_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_preferred_cust_flag", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_birth_year", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "c_birth_country", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "c_email_address", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "CUSTOMER_DEMOGRAPHICS", "pk": "cd_demo_sk", "columns": [{"name": "cd_demo_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "cd_gender", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "cd_marital_status", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "cd_education_status", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "cd_purchase_estimate", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "cd_credit_rating", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "cd_dep_count", "data_type": "INT"}]}, {"name": "STORE", "pk": "s_store_sk", "columns": [{"name": "s_store_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_store_id", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_store_name", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_number_employees", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "s_city", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_state", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}, {"name": "s_country", "data_type": "VARCHAR"}]}, {"name": "STORE_SALES", "pk": "ss_item_sk", "columns": [{"name": "ss_sold_date_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_sold_time_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_item_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_customer_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_cdemo_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_hdemo_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_store_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_ticket_number", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_quantity", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ss_wholesale_cost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_list_price", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_sales_price", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_ext_discount_amt", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_ext_sales_price", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_ext_wholesale_cost", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_ext_list_price", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_ext_tax", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_coupon_amt", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_net_paid", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_net_paid_inc_tax", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "ss_net_profit", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "STORE_RETURNS", "pk": "sr_item_sk", "columns": [{"name": "sr_returned_date_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "sr_item_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "sr_customer_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "sr_ticket_number", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "sr_return_quantity", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "sr_return_amt", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "sr_return_tax", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "sr_return_amt_inc_tax", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "sr_fee", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}, {"name": "sr_net_loss", "data_type": "DECIMAL"}]}, {"name": "WEB_SALES", "pk": "ws_item_sk", "columns": [{"name": "ws_sold_date_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ws_item_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ws_bill_customer_sk", "data_type": "INT"}, {"name": "ws_ship_customer_sk", "data_type": "INT"